The plan in `{{ index .Caps "record.plans" }}/` is the source of truth; the GitHub Project is a
view of it. Never edit the board to record a decision — edit the spec and run:

    ilk mirror plan gh-projects     # what would change on the board
    ilk mirror apply gh-projects    # make the board match

Nothing is written until you have seen the plan, and nothing on the board is ever
deleted. A document that could mean more than one board item is refused rather than
guessed at, because a wrong link is silent and every later sync compounds it.
